cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Overnight Alpha: verifying and stress-testing the overnight return anomaly"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible toolkit that decomposes daily returns into overnight and
  intraday legs, stress-tests the headline magnitudes (compounding, data
  artefacts, selection), and backtests the buy-at-close/sell-at-open strategy
  net of realistic costs. An independent, reproducible response to Knuteson's
  market-manipulation claim.
type: software
